      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1916-07-01_WidnesExaminer_art0055" n="art0055">
        <head>NEW MErv7ttERS.</head>
        <p>NEW MErv7ttERS.</p>
        <p>831 Mary Molloy, 5, Edward-street; age 9; St. Alban's 'School. 832 Eliza Skeld" 98, Cartwright-street; age School. 833 Elsie Chadwick, 104, Cartwrigat-street; age ; 834 Sam Marsh, 45, Bostock-street; age -; -- School. 835 George Emery, 69, Lythgoes-lane; age 13. 836 Frederick Parr, 10, Villas-street; age 10; Parochial School.</p>
        <p>837 Henry Wilkinson, 25, Hume-street; age 9; Parochial School. • 838 Edith Kettle, 52, Parr-street; age 10; School. 839 Walter Richardson, 6, Harbord-street; age 10.</p>
